{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22658","headline":"晚秋夜 · 白居易","name":"晚秋夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧空溶溶月华静，月里愁人吊孤影。\n花开残菊傍疎篱，叶下衰桐落寒井。\n塞鸿飞急觉秋尽，邻鸡鸣迟知夜永。\n凝情不语空所思，风吹白露衣裳冷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}